  "prefLabel": "Cub 305.03 Assessment Ranges for Forest Land Categories",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 305.03 Assessment Ranges for Forest Land Categories. The assessment ranges for forest land categories without documented stewardship shall be as follows:\n\n(a) The category of white pine shall be $132 to $199 per acre;\n\n(b) The category of hardwood shall be $69 to $104 per acre; and\n\n(c) The category of all other shall be $34 to $52 per acre.\n\nSource. #12857-B, eff 8-23-19; ss by #13180, eff 4-1-21; ss by #13360, eff 4-1-22; ss by #13573, eff 4-1-23; ss by #13908, eff 4-1-24; ss by #14204, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14539, eff 4-1-26, EXPIRES: 4-1-36",
